adversarial-review-locality.bats:91:@test "LOC-2 the repair chain is pinned to the answering local voice: no tiny, no claude-headless, no pin — even with an Anthropic key" {
adversarial-review-locality.bats:108:@test "LOC-3 redaction-style: in a whole run with a rejected payload, an Anthropic key and the CLIs present, no hosted alias is ever dispatched" {
adversarial-review-locality.bats:135:@test "LOC-4 one local family on the audit gate: the companion is duplicate_voice, the DEGRADED sentence is in the output, and the gate and verdict-derive treat the envelope as today" {
